.* WRKSPLFA: one spooled file's attributes, over pages; F5 reads them
.* again.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=NUMBER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SPLNBR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTDATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTTIME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DEVICE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OUTPTY CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PAGES CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CURPAGE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=COPIES CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=COPIESLEFT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=FORMTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SAVE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SCHEDULE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=RECORDS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PRTF CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DEVTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=PAGESIZE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=LPI CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CPI CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OVRFLW CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=EXPDATE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNDTA CLASS=TEXTCL.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/SAKEYS' NAME=SAKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSPLFA KEYL=SAKEYS HELP=WRKSPLFA ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Spooled File Attributes
:DATA DEPTH=4 COMPACT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USER' VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:DATAI HELP='FLD/NUMBER' VAR=NUMBER USAGE=OUTPUT.Number
:DATAI HELP='FLD/FILE' VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SPLNBR' VAR=SPLNBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled file number
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CRTDATE' VAR=CRTDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date file opened
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CRTTIME' VAR=CRTTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time file opened
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STATUS' VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OUTQ' VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Output queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OUTQLIB' VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DEVICE' VAR=DEVICE USAGE=OUTPUT.Device or writer printing it
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OUTPTY' VAR=OUTPTY USAGE=OUTPUT.Output priority
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PAGES' VAR=PAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Total pages
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CURPAGE' VAR=CURPAGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Current page
:DATAI HELP='FLD/COPIES' VAR=COPIES USAGE=OUTPUT.Copies
:DATAI HELP='FLD/COPIESLEFT' VAR=COPIESLEFT USAGE=OUTPUT.Copies left to print
:DATAI HELP='FLD/FORMTYPE' VAR=FORMTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Form type
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USRDTA' VAR=USRDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User data
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SAVE' VAR=SAVE USAGE=OUTPUT.Save file
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SCHEDULE' VAR=SCHEDULE USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled output schedule
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RECORDS' VAR=RECORDS USAGE=OUTPUT.Records
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRTF' VAR=PRTF USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer file
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DEVTYPE' VAR=DEVTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Printer device type
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PAGESIZE' VAR=PAGESIZE USAGE=OUTPUT.Page size, lines by positions
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LPI' VAR=LPI USAGE=OUTPUT.Lines per inch
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CPI' VAR=CPI USAGE=OUTPUT.Characters per inch
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OVRFLW' VAR=OVRFLW USAGE=OUTPUT.Overflow line number
:DATAI HELP='FLD/EXPDATE' VAR=EXPDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Expiration date
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USRDFNDTA' VAR=USRDFNDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User defined data
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKSPLFA.Work with Spooled File Attributes - Help
:P.What the system keeps about one spooled file: the job that made it
and when, where it waits and who prints it, its pages and copies, and
how its pages are laid out. F5 reads them again; CHGSPLFA changes
them.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/SAKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOB'.Job
:P.The job, by name, user and number. A job name alone is enough when
only one job has it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USER'.User
:P.The user shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/NUMBER'.Number
:P.The number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/FILE'.File
:P.The file, by name and library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SPLNBR'.Spooled file number
:P.The number of the spooled file among the job's spooled files of the
same name.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CRTDATE'.Date file opened
:P.The date file opened shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CRTTIME'.Time file opened
:P.The time file opened shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/STATUS'.Status
:P.The status shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OUTQ'.Output queue
:P.The output queue the spooled files go to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OUTQLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DEVICE'.Device or writer printing it
:P.The device or writer printing it shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OUTPTY'.Output priority
:P.The priority of the job's spooled files on the output queue, from 1
(highest) to 9 (lowest).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PAGES'.Total pages
:P.The total pages shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CURPAGE'.Current page
:P.The current page shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/COPIES'.Copies
:P.How many copies are printed.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/COPIESLEFT'.Copies left to print
:P.The copies left to print shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/FORMTYPE'.Form type
:P.The type of form the output is printed on. The writer stops for the
form to be loaded when it changes.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRDTA'.User data
:P.User data, up to 10 characters, kept with the object.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SAVE'.Save file
:P.The save file, by name and library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SCHEDULE'.Spooled output schedule
:P.When the spooled file can begin to print&colon. as soon as it is
created, when it is closed, or when the job ends.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RECORDS'.Records
:P.The records shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRTF'.Printer file
:P.The printer file shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DEVTYPE'.Printer device type
:P.The device type.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PAGESIZE'.Page size, lines by positions
:P.The page size, lines by positions shown for what the display is
about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LPI'.Lines per inch
:P.The lines per inch shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CPI'.Characters per inch
:P.The characters per inch shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OVRFLW'.Overflow line number
:P.The overflow line number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EXPDATE'.Expiration date
:P.The date after which the object or file can be deleted or
overwritten. *PERM means it never expires.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRDFNDTA'.User defined data
:P.Data that a user-defined print program can use.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
